{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/ifd56liv2eaq9an4wt0hemeewaxws91.mp3","text":"这里，是这次的文档资料，博士。没见过我做文职工作？可是，比起战斗，我更喜欢......用笔写......","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/qfjtsxxcs2fxrpnv9hghrjgn9cjhqr2.mp3","text":"博士，你看窗外，夜晚......真平静。以前，每个夜晚都充满了火光和焦臭。只有看着现在这样的夜色，我的情绪才能平静下来......","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/44/nygfqwlhrm36p8urt0o4pu1e6ossxex.mp3","text":"有一个红发的瓦伊凡孩子，一直在盯着我看......她在怀疑我的身份吧？但是，她没有证据......哼，不会让她找到的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/65/h2aop1dih6ofyeatvh8ifl7le9xk2y2.mp3","text":"到定期体检的时间了？我......我知道了。但是，我，不相信那些医生。要检查的话......请你，帮我操作。","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c2/fhlri38h7oi9746r12bxtcumd4pvnm4.mp3","text":"你们有很多问题，我不可能回答，这既是为了你好，也是劝阻你们......不要不自量力。","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/de/2lex5kkqdfkguojc4xhlazoyhl47e2u.mp3","text":"......我很强。我知道自己有可怕的力量，但我......不喜欢。你如果想要的话，我就，去战斗......","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/mjz90mfysd3l0jy8n9utjup2vr5fpl9.mp3","text":"这把枪......我不怎么能发挥它的力量。即使这样，它也取走了很多生命。罪恶感？......我们的生命都一样廉价。所以我，没有罪恶感。","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/5d/t2rv7oo2ju822c5dzee4lo2sigiegvt.mp3","text":"矿石病，我不在乎......没有矿石病，我就没机会在这里生活。会剥走我的生命？我，也不在乎......如果大地上有那么多种事物都能杀死你，为什么要单单在意这一种呢？","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/f6b1f71d593behmzm6pcm85daimktsz.mp3","text":"自己是个影子这件事，我不排斥。只有影子才能在这里，隐姓埋名......但是，但是，要是和我有相同面容的人找到了你，不要和她战斗！你会死的，我不想，不想你死......","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0e/0j5qez7zb8m0q8six7gcuty963sugkk.mp3","text":"我会为你守夜的......就请放心地休息吧......晚安。","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:0/03/0anlute86yqynr8pcq2bychejrtlpk1.mp3","text":"是你们......救起了我吗？想知道我的名字？......就叫我“苇草”吧......就像池边的芦苇，怎么样，都可以的......","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f8/4gj2i535eiwtiyeki53eisf3e67hoeq.mp3","text":"你们这样战斗，很辛苦......但是，有很多人能活下去。","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:8/82/chvwezi8erhttvbdihv08letyl3ujw8.mp3","text":"前进，深池的战士们！......以前我常常被迫这么说，实际上，很不喜欢......","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0a/fdl3h92ml05dcm6e2kwp7ozqc3rr6sg.mp3","text":"你有着让我感到平静的梦想，我......想帮你去实现它。只要我煽动深池的火，它会为你在黑夜里烧出道路。","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:7/76/m95pf783ilsagqfd6ik9bteyvcbst94.mp3","text":"战火，会烧尽荒野......","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:2/22/5wpw1kh0cdlyyw4j0qjbzah36nvernk.mp3","text":"既然你嘱咐过我，我就不会再忽视别人的生命......","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/6j1x9e4feqcieuk8jz35wyzba642til.mp3","text":"就这样，我们去收割......","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0f/nurfbbba8pzfapqavgy3fte6osla40y.mp3","text":"你们怎么像麦秆一样易燃......？","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:9/95/rxc6dv61i5e2k44xgeze6y8vsn3zaiy.mp3","text":"我的火，很烫......","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/0kgxd4n6qwrbno4v2fkb7t2w4460vik.mp3","text":"不会有其他人看到我在这吧......？","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:7/75/ekoc5o6e07piteisiv45tsdiuobfuiz.mp3","text":"啊......","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/4f/p339xa0amsg251tljifomh036dyu57w.mp3","text":"只会剩下灰烬......","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/bgmcd9vm88h5nz9pkrrmzdqsprncrn8.mp3","text":"活着的火焰会净化你们污浊的内在。","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6a/j9bd7v5viwsmixvjd5w0fol26lnhdb0.mp3","text":"我就是深池。","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d1/l4url1o6tscgoy0q24ri1aktf300ei9.mp3","text":"我......就是深池！","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/f1/dhvwlqgokin6fgd1za0x2fn5w0a4e0o.mp3","text":"姐姐......","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/rj4g1uccss31kbhiysgqq6bx5a54ist.mp3","text":"无尽的战斗与无尽的闷燃......你不是真的想要这个，对吧？","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e2/qh47utd4hezeme31kwqunb2pbu3dz4v.mp3","text":"如果是为了我们共同的愿望而战，我可以忍受......","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/80/575xpac8j9rhglpsymsel4f7hu0ur6q.mp3","text":"我们又能从战场上得到什么呢？回去吧，我们，快点回去......","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d0/sq1tudxuk8osdgy7hceesynaua9r781.mp3","text":"不。我不会让任何人伤害你......绝不会。","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/ea26c3huz3ntrjourpgtjtgg0lcg47r.mp3","text":"我可以有单独的房间吗？很窄，也不要紧的......","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/gitqllnyh1g86c9rfdca84qlioc86jq.mp3","text":"呃......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:6/63/ecn2mprgjf90yjsl7mmux4jp2q0hpn4.mp3","text":"博士......我的体温，会烫伤你吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9e/2ll4o13ojihtpycnm34mhlxv021zq7a.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/oqwtkga2nw7d1zvkis8ht79t5fobqe2.mp3","text":"啊，被你找到了。为什么没参加聚会？请你......坐在我身边吧。现在的我，看着别人在节日里绽放欢笑，其实，也会觉得心痛的。这场雪，大概不会停下来吧......","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:b/bf/bal0g27sek79ekpaf0x3m2c1f5r71tt.mp3","text":"博士......？不，没什么。","alt":"voice_cn/char_261_sddrag/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f3/lyks5ek1t3u32safp7zijv893434yrn.mp3","text":"这里，是这次的文档资料，博士。没见过我做文职工作？可是，比起战斗，我更喜欢......用笔写......","alt":"voice/char_261_sddrag/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:e/eb/8nb6epj5t8tuzfzuoxrxtzc9omtnrdn.mp3","text":"博士，你看窗外，夜晚......真平静。以前，每个夜晚都充满了火光和焦臭。只有看着现在这样的夜色，我的情绪才能平静下来......","alt":"voice/char_261_sddrag/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/47/1tgjamrlxyw2syv6yx19wrp4vjjsvqa.mp3","text":"有一个红发的瓦伊凡孩子，一直在盯着我看......她在怀疑我的身份吧？但是，她没有证据......哼，不会让她找到的。","alt":"voice/char_261_sddrag/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/b275qd1z306cnugxau8w49itb5d4jcv.mp3","text":"到定期体检的时间了？我......我知道了。但是，我，不相信那些医生。要检查的话......请你，帮我操作。","alt":"voice/char_261_sddrag/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/o12aaxg4epl9y21riq5j5i4wjw7o9tb.mp3","text":"你们有很多问题，我不可能回答，这既是为了你好，也是劝阻你们......不要不自量力。","alt":"voice/char_261_sddrag/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bc/nei46icujqzzyffy4z2g6mjezd1ez60.mp3","text":"......我很强。我知道自己有可怕的力量，但我......不喜欢。你如果想要的话，我就，去战斗......","alt":"voice/char_261_sddrag/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cd/abdq13nz1orw032emypirh0m4ojj5vo.mp3","text":"这把枪......我不怎么能发挥它的力量。即使这样，它也取走了很多生命。罪恶感？......我们的生命都一样廉价。所以我，没有罪恶感。","alt":"voice/char_261_sddrag/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/57/6k8gdb37f03skgk8f1v899ga4lrtnrd.mp3","text":"矿石病，我不在乎......没有矿石病，我就没机会在这里生活。会剥走我的生命？我，也不在乎......如果大地上有那么多种事物都能杀死你，为什么要单单在意这一种呢？","alt":"voice/char_261_sddrag/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/90/r6krmb40lyxxbiiw99dao6xcgi6blr7.mp3","text":"自己是个影子这件事，我不排斥。只有影子才能在这里，隐姓埋名......但是，但是，要是和我有相同面容的人找到了你，不要和她战斗！你会死的，我不想，不想你死......","alt":"voice/char_261_sddrag/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:9/94/38lbdgecsgy5g3m6ec15sh7ot0d9601.mp3","text":"我会为你守夜的......就请放心地休息吧......晚安。","alt":"voice/char_261_sddrag/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:6/62/4fd7ffl9rooex5ax5zddiec2xtqmjsu.mp3","text":"是你们......救起了我吗？想知道我的名字？......就叫我“苇草”吧......就像池边的芦苇，怎么样，都可以的......","alt":"voice/char_261_sddrag/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:7/78/spqh7xsnv17y1sh7w1jqjzupwy2u3xr.mp3","text":"你们这样战斗，很辛苦......但是，有很多人能活下去。","alt":"voice/char_261_sddrag/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:2/28/4gb3f9o4zub428bcjbnwjh0h3fwfehd.mp3","text":"前进，深池的战士们！......以前我常常被迫这么说，实际上，很不喜欢......","alt":"voice/char_261_sddrag/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:6/60/sf36fr2kjs9rizxbe9i6c9734vwclb9.mp3","text":"你有着让我感到平静的梦想，我......想帮你去实现它。只要我煽动深池的火，它会为你在黑夜里烧出道路。","alt":"voice/char_261_sddrag/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4a/9kqvekbpxz8dfh1w9slep4636kg86tc.mp3","text":"战火，会烧尽荒野......","alt":"voice/char_261_sddrag/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/ckrv7vuo25u2m2esf2fw3y9jkrewd6m.mp3","text":"既然你嘱咐过我，我就不会再忽视别人的生命......","